        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Et3N (50 μL) was added dropwise into a Pyrex tube containing H5ovih (0.1 mmol) and 1.5 mL CH3CN and ultrasonically vibrated for 5 min. Gd(NO3)3·6H2O (0.5 mmol) and 0.1 mL distilled water were then added. The mixture was sealed and heated at 80 °C for 96 h, then cooled to room temperature at 0.5 °C min−1 to give orange tetragonal crystals of 1.",
